 "remarks": "Welcome to 18 Caroline Place! Offering over 2,400 square feet of living space, this spacious 5-bedroom, 4-bath home features a versatile multi-level layout ideal for today's lifestyle. Sun-filled interiors showcase hardwood floors, an expansive living room, and a well-appointed kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances. Generously sized bedrooms, including one with heated floors, a recreation room, and additional bonus space provide exceptional flexibility. An oversized deck overlooks a private, tree-lined backyard, perfect for entertaining or relaxing, with a garden available for tenant use. Complete with an attached garage and abundant storage, this Greenwich home offers space, comfort, and endless possibilities.",
